   "answer": "{\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"heading\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"Notice is hereby given that, from Monday 3 November\",\n        \"2025, the Council will change the days on which\",\n        \"household refuse and garden waste are collected in\",\n        \"the Umber Cormorant district. The change follows the review\",\n        \"of rounds approved by the Environment Committee and\",\n        \"applies to every household named in the schedule held at the\",\n        \"Town Hall.\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
